This package plugs into LeRobot (Hugging Face, Apache-2.0,
https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot) through its public plugin interface;
it contains no LeRobot code.  Instructions are tokenised with the tokenizer of
SmolVLM2-500M-Video-Instruct (Hugging Face, Apache-2.0), downloaded by
LeRobot at run time.

The AMP Tadpole weights are not part of this package.  They are published
separately under CC BY-NC 4.0, with commercial licences from Adaptive Machine
Patterns Ltd: https://huggingface.co/Adaptive-Machine-Patterns/amp-tadpole-lerobot

